{"id":"d6775c3d8129c651","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-beltfunction.md","title":"Symmetric Boolean belt functions","display":"df-beltfunction — Symmetric Boolean belt functions","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-beltfunction","aliases":["27-df-beltfunction"],"display":"df-beltfunction — Symmetric Boolean belt functions","depends_on":["[[27-df-nat]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_pdf_sha256":"1f81062da95a70f9a4f89063cdedaaec08946ffbc117c7345baa7065770cfa1f","source_section":"§3.4.1","source_printed_pages":"159,160","source_pdf_pages":"183,184","verification_status":"source-definition-checked-with-local-derivation","local_review_status":"formally-reviewed-2026-10-20; source-not-rechecked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-beltfunction"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-beltfunction</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-beltfunction — Symmetric Boolean belt functions"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d87d01e5686c19fe\" href=\"?note=d87d01e5686c19fe\" title=\"27-df-nat\">27-df-nat</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_pdf_sha256","html":"1f81062da95a70f9a4f89063cdedaaec08946ffbc117c7345baa7065770cfa1f"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§3.4.1"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"159,160"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"183,184"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-definition-checked-with-local-derivation"},{"key":"local_review_status","html":"formally-reviewed-2026-10-20; source-not-rechecked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge1}\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge1}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m,k\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(m,k\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m+k\\le n\">\\(m+k\\le n\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\">\\(a\\in\\{0,1\\}^n\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"b_{n,m,k}(a)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}1,&amp;m\\le\\sum_{i=1}^n a_i\\le m+k,\\\\0,&amp;\\sum_{i=1}^n a_i&lt;m\\;\\lor\\;\\sum_{i=1}^n a_i&gt;m+k.\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[b_{n,m,k}(a)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}1,&amp;m\\le\\sum_{i=1}^n a_i\\le m+k,\\\\0,&amp;\\sum_{i=1}^n a_i&lt;m\\;\\lor\\;\\sum_{i=1}^n a_i&gt;m+k.\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>带函数在连续若干 Hamming 层上为真，是研究素项数极值的具体函数族。m=0,k=n 给出常一函数；k=0 给出单一层，通常并非单调函数。两个分支互斥且覆盖所有输入。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-nat","status":"resolved","id":"d87d01e5686c19fe","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-nat]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"m,k\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"m+k\\le n","display":false},{"tex":"a\\in\\{0,1\\}^n","display":false},{"tex":"b_{n,m,k}(a)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}1,&m\\le\\sum_{i=1}^n a_i\\le m+k,\\\\0,&\\sum_{i=1}^n a_i<m\\;\\lor\\;\\sum_{i=1}^n a_i>m+k.\\end{cases}","display":true}],"bytes":1313,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-23","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[27-df-beltfunction|df-beltfunction — Symmetric Boolean belt functions]]"},{"id":"c4b39c5016bde05b","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge1}$，$m,k\\in\\mathbb N$，$m+k\\le n$，$b_{n,m,k}$ 见 [[27-df-beltfunction]]；$\\mathrm{PI}$ 见 [[27-df-piset]]。对不交 $P,N\\subseteq[n]$，$C_{P,N}$ 是下节构造的项函数。"}],"outgoing":["d87d01e5686c19fe"]}